	// MECHANISM-1: p95 is driven by worst-case queueing in cache_warmup; using queue-depth directly for penalty scaling catches transient spikes that EffectiveLoad misses, and CacheHitRate helps choose between equally-loaded instances
	// EXPECT-1: avg_p95_ms < 5050
